    "detailed_description": "<h1>board designs</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/02e77ba37e9a15d8684b13bd178c2ecd.avif?t=1754767590\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/c06cb5596e6e4445382cf2d764534fb0.avif?t=1754767590\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/37be8cf3cb80feed0528e3998bd8f963.poster.avif?t=1754767590\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/37be8cf3cb80feed0528e3998bd8f963.webm?t=1754767590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/37be8cf3cb80feed0528e3998bd8f963.mp4?t=1754767590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/a6c9611e0ba9f06569e50b07aaf55d94.avif?t=1754767590\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/91907608383b6dd8d6e5c57f37f00c54.avif?t=1754767590\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/db8f643ad77d021fbd1efd044ed27870.webp?t=1754767590\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/925439316badecffb98b75e19e0f1591.avif?t=1754767590\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coordinated multi - angle offensive is the most important feature of this game.  It allows to create scoring opportunities from many angles simultaneously what makes for a dynamic and exciting play.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simply  direct any two points from your team towards the opponent's net and score if the line is open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game features three board designs with zoom options which can additionally be personalized with use of a screen drawing program. Simple rules - great actions !!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RULES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/8b696e5c86de39544b4d739baf1209c1.avif?t=1754767590\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/77966b92a534c5e98a08474251d5c335.avif?t=1754767590\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/b821c923092dd08a9298f04043ccb6de.avif?t=1754767590\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/db8f643ad77d021fbd1efd044ed27870.webp?t=1754767590\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/c06cb5596e6e4445382cf2d764534fb0.avif?t=1754767590\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/37be8cf3cb80feed0528e3998bd8f963.poster.avif?t=1754767590\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/37be8cf3cb80feed0528e3998bd8f963.webm?t=1754767590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/37be8cf3cb80feed0528e3998bd8f963.mp4?t=1754767590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/a6c9611e0ba9f06569e50b07aaf55d94.avif?t=1754767590\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/91907608383b6dd8d6e5c57f37f00c54.avif?t=1754767590\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/db8f643ad77d021fbd1efd044ed27870.webp?t=1754767590\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><